# baseline

> A repository overlay that governs how Claude Code works in your codebase, from
> intake to commit. Rules are enforced at the tool boundary by hooks that run
> before the model is consulted, so a blocked call ends at the guard. Install is
> one npx command; you bring your own Claude Code. Source and the full
> constitution live at {{ site.repo }}.

